                "text": "Ken Paxton is so desperate to maintain the blessing of Donald Trump and RFK Jr. that he becomes the first state attorney general to push the unproven claim linking autism to Tylenol.\n\nAbandoning medical science for a conspiracy theory-driven agenda means Republican leaders are offering more distraction, more measles, and more harm to Texans seeking credible responses to their health care needs.",
