                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": ".@foundcom is a cornerstone of our community, helping tens of thousands Central Texans obtain affordable health care.\n\nFriday, I join them to discuss the affordability crisis working families face from soaring premiums. Though defunded by Trump, @foundcom has rallied volunteers and local financial support in order to continue providing free, objective evaluation of health insurance alternatives for each individual. Their good work remains ever more valuable in helping neighbors find the best plan\u2014you have options, make an appointment now.\n\nPleased to join them and @centralhealthtx to kick off ACA Open Enrollment. https://t.co/S7IWApBDu7",
