                "text": "Travelers inbound to Austin will continue to face frequent delays because of a serious air traffic controller shortage that predates the government shutdown\u2014only 27 of the FAA-recommended 60.  \n\nInstead of continuing their shutdown, the GOP should sit down to resolve the health care crisis they\u2019ve created before we experience a true air travel crisis.",
