                "text": "Trump is correct! The shutdown is a big negative for Republicans because it is a big negative for millions who will lose their access to a physician.\n\nFor five weeks, Republicans have refused to even discuss a bipartisan response to the health care crisis they have created. Only Trump can end his shutdown, and I hope he will do so to end the damage he and his enablers are causing.",
