                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As I told KVUE from home yesterday, while eager to end the government shutdown, I refuse to support a shutdown of health care access to a physician for millions of Americans.\u00a0 \n\nAfter voting more than 70 times to replace Obamacare with Nothingcare, Republicans again refused during the last 6 weeks to negotiate any bipartisan resolution of the health care crisis they have created for many of our neighbors.",
