                "text": "After enacting the largest health care cut in American history, Trump and Republicans now seek to replace Obamacare with Nothingcare. While I am pleased that those who suffered during the shutdown are getting some relief, this shameful bill completely abandons the millions of hardworking citizens who are likely to soon lose access to a physician.\nhttps://t.co/8ZcezL73v6",
