                "text": "Joined Public Health Watch, a valuable resource for news on issues that impact us all, under the leadership of Jim Morris and Board Chair Annette LoVoi.\u00a0An important conversation on the health impacts of climate change with Jeff Goodell, author of The Heat Will Kill You. From rising heat to growing health inequities, climate challenges demand accountability and action.\n\u00a0\nAppreciative of journalists who expose dangers and ensure every community is heard.",
