                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I give thanks for my family, for my excellent health, and for the opportunity my neighbors have given me to serve the only place I have ever called home. This year I am especially thankful for all those who have been coming out in ever increasing numbers to reject Trump regime authoritarianism and demand the preservation of our freedoms and democracy. \n\nFrom our family to yours, best wishes for a joyful Thanksgiving.",
