                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With many Americans facing soaring health insurance premiums, higher prices from Trump\u2019s tariff taxes, appropriations to maintain federal operations still unapproved, House GOP considers only marginal issues.\u00a0 \n\n\u201cThe government shutdown is over, but when it comes to Congress it\u2019s hard to tell.\u201d\u00a0While I rarely agree with its editorials, WSJ provides a fitting description: \u201cAn Agenda-Less GOP Congress\u201d \u201cRepublicans don\u2019t seem to have any priorities beyond populist stunts.\u201d https://t.co/29lKgkbmpI?\u2026",
