                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Rather than responding to the health care crisis, which he did so much to create, Speaker Johnson recessed the House early for the holidays. \n\nThe self-styled, Republican \u201cmoderates,\u201d who belatedly joined our petition to discharge a bill to extend the Affordable Care Act credits, stalled until it was too little too late. \n\nThen they voted against our motion which would have provided relief this week to millions of Americans instead of the anguish caused by more delay and uncertainty.",
